{"bookInfo":{"bookId":"42000016375","bookName":"Me cansé de ser tu sustituta","cover":"https://thwztchapter.dramaboxdb.com/data/cppartner/4x2/42x0/420x0/42000016375/42000016375.jpg@w=360&h=640","viewCount":841437,"followCount":19362,"introduction":"Tres años después de casarse con un hombre doce años mayor, Lucía descubre que su esposo Carlos nunca olvidó a su verdadero amor, Laura. Para él, ella solo fue una sustituta. Con el corazón roto, pide el divorcio. Un día lo ve rescatar a Laura de un matrimonio forzado. Ante todos, rompe las cartas, muestra el divorcio y desaparece. Cuando Carlos comprende que Lucía era su amor, ya es tarde. Al reencontrarla, ella ama a otro, y su mundo se derrumba.","chapterCount":64,"labels":["Second Chance","Forced Love"],"tags":["Second Chance","Forced Love"],"typeTwoIds":[355,294],"typeTwoNames":["Amor Enredado","Romántica"],"typeTwoList":[{"id":355,"name":"Amor Enredado","replaceName":"amor-enredado"},{"id":294,"name":"Romántica","replaceName":"romántica"}],"language":"SPANISH","typeTwoName":"Amor-Enredado","simpleLanguage":"es","bookNameEn":"Me-cansé-de-ser-tu-sustituta","bookNameLower":"me-cansé-de-ser-tu-sustituta","shelfTime":"2026-06-12 10:23:37","firstShelfTime":"2026-06-12 10:23:37","performerIdList":[]},"chapterList":[{"id":"701016150","index":0,"unlock":true,"mp4":"https://hwvideoseo.dramaboxdb.com/05/5x7/57x3/573x6/57361000024/701016150_1/701016150.720p.narrowv3.mp4?Expires=1795197600&Signature=ZlU0iw73fvygbyTqHdXLt5EWZ1dnf4mtXfcwHOkLC-pJ4nI9UokvTTcmWzzvMhspxutb-QjPEAoi9~0jZ-KPejJY5JWtteFHtvoPZjSSxeH1LIuGrfwv9R95ZrvObBKma75c3EalNp3jPsn6565YP5hNVQU8f4cSvxsxelKSs69TXS8yqM-MFomqGyOUbdImkk1KJYD2uqeqL4i90JD6t7HYfFwtjka3GeJr7jZBSgWJ9PT8zzF7TJghX092xjI8VXdKZizJEpv716cY8zjj~mAIsKFPFKSPiEtwMFkJaCe5LwQIIzV7PUKaAJeYOSXT9XYzSuabi9khxJMjYvIhNg__&Key-Pair-Id=K3HA2TLE2QH99V","cover":"https://thwztvideo.dramaboxdb.com/05/5x7/57x3/573x6/57361000024/701016150_1/701016150.mp4.jpg@w=100&h=135","duration":168606,"price":0},{"id":"701016151","in